# 公開檔案白名單；新增檔案須另行檢查後才開放。
*
!README.md
!requirements.txt
!.gitignore
!notebooks/
notebooks/*
!notebooks/yoxi_cleaning.ipynb
!notebooks/yoxi_analysis_01.ipynb
!notebooks/yoxi_modeling_02.ipynb
!notebooks/yoxi_modeling_03.ipynb
!demo/
demo/*
!demo/index.html

